# fortress-rollback-godot devcontainer secrets — template.
#
# On first open, the devcontainer copies this file to
# .devcontainer/devcontainer.env (gitignored). Fill in the keys you use;
# everything here is OPTIONAL — the container works without any of it.
#
# This file is passed to the container via `docker run --env-file`, so every
# variable defined here is visible inside the container: terminals, VS Code,
# Claude Code, OpenCode, and the gh CLI.
#
# NEVER commit devcontainer.env or paste real keys anywhere else.

# ── GitHub ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by the `gh` CLI and the GitHub MCP server. Scopes: repo, read:org.
# Format rules (docker --env-file semantics — violations cause SILENT
# corruption): one KEY=value per line; NO quotes around values; NO inline
# comments after values; no `export`. Blank lines and full-line comments
# starting with # are fine. Example of a BROKEN line:
#   GITHUB_TOKEN="ghp_x"        # quotes become part of the token
#
# The GitHub MCP server reads this token as MCP_GITHUB_PAT, derived
# automatically — you only set GITHUB_TOKEN here. If the token ever fails to
# reach the MCP layer through that derivation, set MCP_GITHUB_PAT directly
# (same value) as a fallback.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# ── OpenRouter ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OpenCode provider; optional Claude Code routing (see bottom).
# https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# ── z.ai GLM Coding Plan ───────────────────────────────────────────
# OpenCode `zai-coding-plan` provider.
# https://z.ai/manage-apikey/apikey-list
ZAI_API_KEY=

# ── Claude Code provider routing (optional) ────────────────────────
# Default (everything below unset): native Anthropic — run `claude /login`.
#
# To route Claude Code through z.ai instead, uncomment:
#   ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.z.ai/api/anthropic
#   ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=<paste your ZAI_API_KEY value>
#
# To route Claude Code through OpenRouter instead, uncomment:
#   ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api
#   ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=<paste your OPENROUTER_API_KEY value>
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY must stay present and EMPTY, or Claude Code may
# bypass OpenRouter and hit Anthropic directly.)
